  "details": "All of the buttons in the quick menu when selecting a player should have been duplicated into the social menu when the menus were updated for the new features. The fact that this has not already been done is outright infuriating because not only should it have been apart of the update but there is no reason not to have them there.\n \nIn fact there are more reasons to have the buttons duplicated. Duplicating the buttons does not mean a menu overhaul, which we are still waiting on, it just means we can access the various features in a more reliable way while we wait for the big menu overhaul that is still meant to come.\n\nEDIT:\nFor other examples this canny post relates to the requested features of: \n- https://vrchat.canny.io/feature-requests/p/avatar-cloning-on-social-menu\n- https://vrchat.canny.io/feature-requests/p/show-unblock-avatar-button-in-the-social-tab",
